// Fix 2026-10-05: SRATOOLS_PREFETCH intermittently fails against NCBI's SRA Data Locator
// ("Cannot nest groups near index 72" -- a backend query-parser error, hit on a different
// accession each time, consistent with community-reported prefetch reliability problems under
// high concurrency, e.g. https://github.com/ncbi/sra-tools/issues/560). Previously this was only
// handled by retrying the WHOLE ~150-accession fetchngs invocation (run_fetchngs_with_retry in
// run_batched.sh), which kills every other in-flight fetch and restarts the entire batch from
// scratch -- nf-core/fetchngs's own default error handling only auto-retries specific
// resource-exhaustion exit codes, not this one. This instead retries just the one failing task,
// up to 5 times, leaving its ~149 unaffected siblings running.
//
// `.*SRATOOLS_PREFETCH` (not a bare name): nf-core/fetchngs nests this process under a longer
// qualified path (NFCORE_FETCHNGS:SRA:FASTQ_DOWNLOAD_PREFETCH_FASTERQDUMP_SRATOOLS:
// SRATOOLS_PREFETCH) -- Nextflow's withName selector matches against the fully qualified name, so
// a bare `SRATOOLS_PREFETCH` would not match here.
process {
    withName: '.*SRATOOLS_PREFETCH' {
        errorStrategy = 'retry'
        maxRetries    = 5
    }
}
